                </p>

                <ul class="access-steps">

                    <li>
                        ${ACCESS_ICONS.install}
                        <span>
                            <b>Install the App</b>
                            Once installed, add the app to your home screen
                        </span>
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        ${ACCESS_ICONS.shortcut}
                        <span>
                            <b>App Shortcut</b>
                            Select Add Shortcut or Add to Home Screen.
                        </span>
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        ${ACCESS_ICONS.bell}
                        <span>
                            <b>Allow Notifications</b>
                            Never miss an update during your stay
                        </span>
                    </li>

                </ul>

                <p
                    class="access-note ${iphone ? '' : 'd-none'}"
                    id="iphoneNote">

                    ${ACCESS_ICONS.share}

                    <span>
                        On iPhone: tap <b>Share</b> in Safari,
                        then <b>Add to Home Screen</b>.
